                "text": "Taking your kid to the doctor when they\u2019re sick isn\u2019t something only the ultra-rich should get to do. Neither are mammograms, eye exams, or visits to the dentist.\n\nToday, we talked about how a 20% spike in insurance costs is putting health care out of reach for Michigan families. https://t.co/5tzxey4fvG",
