                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "MAGA forced a health care affordability crisis on Michigan families. After $1 trillion in Medicaid cuts and gutting the ACA, insurance premiums are out of control and people can\u2019t get basic care. \n\nWe urgently need a bipartisan budget with real solutions to fix these costs and open the government. I remain ready to work on it, but caving without health care solutions would fail countless working families who are struggling to get by.",
