                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "High costs are crushing families in my community, and Republicans are forcing a health care affordability crisis on working people. Because they cut $1 trillion from Medicaid and are gutting the ACA, insurance premiums are spiraling out of control and people can\u2019t get basic care.\n\nWe urgently need a bipartisan budget that addresses the real needs of the people I represent. This bill fails. Tonight, I voted no because we need concrete solutions to deliver affordable health care, not empty promises.",
